공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 되었</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">으나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #000066; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. 2011</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년도 이후 수강한 복수전공 및 부전공 이수구분은 포기</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-pad